From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:57:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] squash! ci: Build the GenUI-min configuration and report its
 size

Set the Bencher threshold for the GenUI-min sizes from the ohos-main
runs: an alert when a size grows by more than 0.1% over the previous
push, with the percentage test on one sample. The sizes are
deterministic, so the tests that estimate noise from the spread of the
samples have none to work with, and an average of several samples would
keep alerting for a few pushes after each jump. Pull requests already
take the thresholds over from their base, and `--thresholds-reset`
keeps the workflow the only place that sets them.

Validation: `bencher run --dry-run` (CLI 0.6.13) with the job's script: the push report carries the file-size threshold (percentage, max_sample_size 1, upper_boundary 0.001, which Bencher's documentation defines as 0.1%), and the pull request report is unchanged. actionlint reports nothing new.
AI-assisted: Yes (agent session; written by the agent)
Signed-off-by: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
---
 .github/workflows/ohos-genui-min.yml | 9 ++++++---
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/.github/workflows/ohos-genui-min.yml b/.github/workflows/ohos-genui-min.yml
index e63eb0d04e8..5b106e38d50 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/ohos-genui-min.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/ohos-genui-min.yml
@@ -135,10 +135,13 @@ jobs:
           jq -n --argjson library "$LIBRARY_SIZE" --argjson hap "$HAP_SIZE" \
             '{"libservoshell.stripped.so": {"file-size": {"value": $library}}, "servoshell-default-unsigned.hap": {"file-size": {"value": $hap}}}' > size.json
           if [ "$GITHUB_EVENT_NAME" = pull_request ]; then
-            branch=(--branch "$PR_NUMBER/PR" --hash "$HEAD_SHA" --start-point "$GITHUB_BASE_REF" \
+            options=(--branch "$PR_NUMBER/PR" --hash "$HEAD_SHA" --start-point "$GITHUB_BASE_REF" \
               --start-point-hash "$BASE_SHA" --start-point-reset --start-point-clone-thresholds)
           else
-            branch=(--branch ohos-main --hash "$GITHUB_SHA")
+            # The sizes are deterministic, so each push is compared with the previous one.
+            options=(--branch ohos-main --hash "$GITHUB_SHA" --threshold-measure file-size \
+              --threshold-test percentage --threshold-max-sample-size 1 --threshold-upper-boundary 0.001 \
+              --thresholds-reset)
           fi
-          bencher run --project servo-ohos "${branch[@]}" --testbed aarch64-unknown-linux-ohos \
+          bencher run --project servo-ohos "${options[@]}" --testbed aarch64-unknown-linux-ohos \
             --adapter json --file size.json --github-actions "$GITHUB_TOKEN"
